Troy Goode and Douglas Christopher Wilson own most of the code that survives at HEAD, with Troy Goode ahead. I counted the author of each line with `git blame`, ignoring whitespace-only changes and the formatting commit.

| Author | Surviving lines (ignoring the reformat) |
