**Troy Goode owns the most code that is still here, followed by Douglas Christopher Wilson.** Counts are surviving lines at HEAD from `git blame`, not commits.

| Author | Surviving lines | Share | Commits | Share |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode (2 addresses merged, a guess) | 810 | 40.8% | 95 | 30.1% |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 629 | 31.7% | 143 | 45.3% |
| Íñigo Marquínez Prado | 95 | 4.8% | 2 | 0.6% |
| Jon Church | 72 | 3.6% | 3 | 0.9% |
| Sebastian Beltran | 67 | 3.4% | 2 | 0.6% |
